{"id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-determinacy.md","title":"Determinacy","display":"df-determinacy — Determinacy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-determinacy","aliases":["58-df-determinacy"],"display":"df-determinacy — Determinacy","depends_on":["[[58-df-winning-strategy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-determinacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-determinacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-determinacy — Determinacy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"58-df-winning-strategy\">58-df-winning-strategy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V\">\\(M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Outcome}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Outcome}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"58-df-winning-strategy\">58-df-winning-strategy</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的树博弈决定性谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 为自然数走子、完整有限序列树上的决定性接口，使用与三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}\\)</span> 相同的收益集约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\land\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\\\[-1pt]&amp;{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\land\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\\\[-1pt]&amp;{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}baire}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Det}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}baire}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Det}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\)</span> 只断言这一个以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为 I 方收益集的树博弈由某一方拥有获胜策略。</li>\n<li>AD 是对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\omega\">\\(M=\\omega\\)</span> 的相应博弈类全称量化的独立公理，不能与单局决定性定义混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-winning-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-winning-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-winning-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\\subseteq V^4$ and $\\mathrm{Outcome}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-winning-strategy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Outcome}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\land\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\exists\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\\\[-1pt]&{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M))\\Bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}baire}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Det}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{<\\omega},A,\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1632,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d9a0edf2840ec30","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]])"},{"id":"8e3443388df2630d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"02b395ed6f22c079","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"58fa010572b8898a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}\\subseteq V^3$（树、收益集与走子集三元决定性谓词, see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]）"},{"id":"adf383c642517545","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)$ (determinacy predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]])"},{"id":"5a99f1813d80f3c2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)$ (three-place determined-game predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]])"},{"id":"10b43f4fd4ac0d83","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)$ is the exact three-argument determinacy predicate from [[58-df-determinacy]] and $\\mathrm{Woodin}$ is the Woodin-cardinal predicate from [[58-df-woodin]]."},{"id":"0624e99112a7488f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}_S$ 使用 [[58-df-determinacy]] 的自然数完整树专门化；大基数前提按 Woodin 依赖的类量词元语言解释。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md|58-df-determinacy]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["b74c79bf773960d3"]}